"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s: s.social_audit_current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.batch_traceability, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"已有有效控制\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(supplier):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> RISK_RULES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](supplier))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(supplier):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score(supplier)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"T1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"T2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"T3\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"T4\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这套规则的价值不在于权重精确（多数企业都需要按自己的物料结构调），而在于<strong>它把&quot;分层&quot;从一次会议变成一个可审计的计算</strong>。审计发现（<code>R-CTL-01</code>）作为负权重进入评分，实现了前面说的闭环：管理动作直接改善层级，而不是靠人工重新判断。</p>\n<p>分层结果的直接用途有两个：决定 <a href=\"../supplier-social-due-diligence/code-of-conduct-contract-clause\">行为准则与合同尽责条款</a> 的施压强度，以及决定 <a href=\"../supplier-social-due-diligence/social-audit-smeta-slcp\">社会责任审计（SMETA/SLCP）与改进</a> 的投入深度。分层依据中的物料维度又依赖第三章的追溯模型，见 <a href=\"../traceability-evidence-chain/material-factory-origin-genealogy\">原料/工厂/产地追溯链建模</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分层的前提是区分固有风险（未施加控制时的基线风险）与剩余风险（管控后仍存在的风险）。</li>\n<li>排序输入包括地理、行业、物料（BOM 展开）与业务维度（金额、替代难度），物料维度最容易被忽略也最有效。</li>\n<li>四级模型 T1-T4 把层级固定映射到准入要求、审计频率与数据要求；T4 用于新供应商的过渡管理。</li>\n<li>分层必须由事件触发重评：清单更新、审计发现、厂址变更、新物料引入。</li>\n<li>用可解释的规则引擎落地分层，审计与合同动作作为负权重反馈回评分，形成闭环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"供应商分层与高风险品类地区","id":"供应商分层与高风险品类地区"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：固有风险与剩余风险","id":"核心概念-固有风险与剩余风险"},{"level":2,"text":"风险排序的输入","id":"风险排序的输入"},{"level":3,"text":"地理与行业维度","id":"地理与行业维度"},{"level":3,"text":"物料维度与 BOM 展开","id":"物料维度与-bom-展开"},{"level":3,"text":"采购金额与替代难度","id":"采购金额与替代难度"},{"level":2,"text":"分层模型","id":"分层模型"},{"level":3,"text":"分层不是一次性的","id":"分层不是一次性的"},{"level":2,"text":"高风险品类与地区识别的落地","id":"高风险品类与地区识别的落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"德国 LkSG 与英澳现代奴役法矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supply-chain-social-due-diligence-forced-labor/forced-labor-regulation/lksg-modern-slavery-matrix"},"next":{"title":"行为准则与合同尽责条款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supply-chain-social-due-diligence-forced-labor/supplier-social-due-diligence/code-of-conduct-contract-clause"}}